+The Virtual Magic Window (VMW) was introduced as a collateral implementation of the Virtual Magic Lantern (VML) in the paper "The virtual magic lantern" [S1]. It is based on the Magic Lens metaphor but adapted for volume rendering with a 3D pointer device (Wanda device) [S1]. The method was designed to be efficient and easy to adapt to GPU ray casting algorithms [S1].
 
